meta {
  name: Competition
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{newBase}}/competitions/{{compId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.id: isNumber
}

docs {
  Adds three fields over the legacy `getcompetitioninfo`:

  - `timezone` — IANA, replaces the DST-lossy `timediff` → zone lookup table in
    `lib/helpers/time.ts`. **Optional**: competition 40488 returns it empty, so
    `timediff` has to stay as the fallback.
  - `isPublic` — a real boolean, was `1`.
  - `serverTime` — epoch ms, usable to correct clock skew in the `isLive` check.

  Unknown ids 404 here, where the legacy endpoint returned a body. See
  quirks/Unknown competition.
}
